to do is discard whatever cards they were holding. 
"}
{"fragment":"F2018-QA-L495-FR001","location":{"pdf_page":6,"extraction_line_start_1_based":497,"extraction_line_end_1_based":498},"text":"A: The deal may be one-sided, however at least 1 colony or card 
must change hands.
"}
{"fragment":"F2018-QA-L516-FR002","location":{"pdf_page":6,"extraction_line_start_1_based":519,"extraction_line_end_1_based":523},"text":"A: You may be explicit or vague in the terms of your deal, but you 
may not lie about what you are offering, and must abide by the 
terms of your deal with regard to colonies and cards changing 
hands (e.g., if you say “I will give you my highest attack card,” 
you must do so if that is part of the deal).
"}
{"fragment":"F2018-QA-L531-FR002","location":{"pdf_page":6,"extraction_line_start_1_based":533,"extraction_line_end_1_based":533},"text":"Any given flare may only be played once per encounter.
"}
