Do you have to play it each time you want to use it, or is it automatic?
"}
{"fragment":"F2018-QA-L1563-FR002","location":{"pdf_page":17,"extraction_line_start_1_based":1565,"extraction_line_end_1_based":1567},"text":"A: Macron’s power may be zapped either when launching ships (to 
